{
  "id": "ACT.28",
  "number": "28",
  "bookId": "ACT",
  "reference": "Ighisyewut 28",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 31,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "28",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "ACT 28"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "28",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 28:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyini kikïchïwïtyeghecha nanam aketïk kor wölo tïyame, kenkïtucha lö kïkuro korononi kikwen pögh, Malta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.28.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.28.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 28:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïnamenecha piko korononi kongot nyoman. Kinoghwecha ma, akïtakecha lapay. Ompöwölo kökikutor kïropan akïkaghïtit. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.28.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.28.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 28:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akwotini kimi Paulö kïrïngöy kwen atökutö nökögh, kungwïna moroya kwenchay ompö kilayata ma, akïnanagh ewunyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.28.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.28.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 28:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïsïwa pïchay pö koronay kïyïsö moroyonay ewu Paulö, kïmwochï kegh lö, “Kipörisyö chichï nyoman, wölo kïrkegh kachïwïta nanam, wölo möpïsininye manpa Tororöt kïsöp.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.28.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.28.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 28:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wölo kusösokï Paulö moroyonay ma amedanye kïgh nyinte nyonikïny. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.28.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.28.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 28:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kikönöy lö kutu portanyi, anta wir ngwïny lawel akïma. Kïkany kïkönyisyö nyo kogh amökïsïwa Paulö kuchir, kïwaghach kinonutyengwa akïlö, “Chichete kï tororöt!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.28.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.28.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 28:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.28.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.28.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 28:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kimito atolekïtö atoni pareni wowïnto korononi kikwen pögh nyo kikuro Puplio. Kïtakecha nyo karam, kelïkucha toyechi osis sömök. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.28.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.28.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 28:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kirïwöy papoto Puplio pöröy kyamate tïnyon, akuyitoy kisön. Kïlït Paulö konyi akukanagh ewunechi parakunyi akïsagh, kïsöp nyinte. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.28.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.28.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 28:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïkany kusop lenyoni, kïpkana pich löwïr koronay cho kichirsot, akesop. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.28.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.28.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 28:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïropkecha tïkwïn cho chang, kïkany kengetenacha meli, kutö melinay tïkwïn cho kikïmökecha ompö rutogh.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.28.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.28.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kangeta Paulö Malta kïwö Rumi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 28:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.28.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.28.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 28:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kikimpuröcha atoni aro sömök, atolapay kepeghecha meli nyo kingwïno Aleksandria, nyo kingwïn kïpöghön atoni ompö aroyo kaghïtan. Kikuro melinoni, “Tororötin cho le Sala.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.28.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.28.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 28:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ketacha kanasyanta Sirakusa, ketïpicha atoni osis sömök. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.28.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.28.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 28:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kengetecha atoni ompö meli kerelöcha kanasyanta Rekio. Kutor yomöt nyo kikutuno okumpö tagh asista nyo kirïptoy, ketucha asisto odeny kanasyanta Puteoli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.28.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.28.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 28:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kenyorucha pich cho le kighönï, kelïkucha toyekwa ompö wiki akonga. Nka nyoni nyu wölini kikïpkantecha ntöketï Rumi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.28.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.28.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 28:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïkany kïlïm kighönï cho kimi Rumi lö kïpïnucha or, kïpka ntökwitï Donyo Apio nko Korïn Sömök cho pö To kïtorokecha. Nyini kïsïwa Paulö chane kïsal Tororöt akïsïch nyakanan.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.28.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.28.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mi Paulö Rumi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 28:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.28.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.28.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 28:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyini kikitacha Rumi, kepïsï Paulö kïtöpö onkït nko askaryon nyo kiripöy nyinte.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.28.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.28.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 28:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.28.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.28.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 28:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïkany kumpur Paulö osis sömök, kïkur kintöghoghi pipö Yaudi cho kimi wöloni kïpka kokwö. Nyini kituyö pïchay, kïlenchï, “Werköcho! Kïrkegh kimaghanye kïgh nyo kichuniö nko piköcho anta otöptinecho cho kikïnyorchï papotïnecho, Kï kitötanïn pipö Yaudi kïratanïn pipö Rumi ompö Yerusalem. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.28.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.28.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 28:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïkïtenanïn ngal tökïmach kutyakanïn, ompöwölo kipköchï lö, kimaghanye kïgh nyo kimïchini ketïghenanïn. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.28.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.28.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 28:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.25.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ist 25:11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Wölo nyini kitagh pipö Yaudi ketyakanïn, kïmasïwanye nyu or anka kïpoto orirchan pöytoghin. Amelö ompöwölo kyotïngetan kïgh nyo orwokyinegho piköcho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.28.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.28.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 28:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nka nyoni katepan onyorwokwa atangalan nko akwa, ompöwölo kakïratenanïn sïrïmnyontonï ompö nyinte nyini le kikönöto pipö Israel.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.28.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.28.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 28:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.28.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.28.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 28:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïlenchï pïchay, “Tomönye kesïköcha palalyan nyo ngwïno Yudea nyo poru lö ichinyi lelate, akïtomönye kelïmacha ngal chonikïny ompö kighönicho cho pkono wölini, anta mwa ngölyon nyo gha ompö nyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.28.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.28.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 28:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wölo kïmökecha kelïme wölini inontonenyi nyinte, ompöwölo kinkïtöcha lö taghate pich lapay tuyononi le nyengu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.28.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.28.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 28:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.28.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.28.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 28:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïkany kïchomnyechï asistangwa, kïpka pich cho chang wölini kimöngöy Paulö. Kïngalan nko chane ngala Pöyunöto Tororöt ompö tatat kïngeta otini kiyech ntökwimön. Akumukyï lasiny kupurchï chane lö tökïpköchï lö ki pö man ngalechoni kimwochini nyinte chane ompö paraku Yeso, otini kineto chane Kirurut pö Musa nko ngala werkoy. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.28.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.28.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 28:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïcham walaka ompö chane ngalechi, wölo kimemïcha walaka tökughan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.28.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.28.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 28:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïnget kïpa akïmi kumölöy kegh achane, otini kökikuwang Paulö kïmwochï chane ngölyon akonga nyo kilö, “Nkïchï nyoman nyay kimwochï werkoyon Isaya papotïnekwa ompö owesyo Mïkulögh nyo Tïlil! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.28.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.28.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 28:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
